<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: PRAGUE BREWERIES POST '96 LOSS-CZECH ACCT.</title>
<headline>PRAGUE BREWERIES POST '96 LOSS-CZECH ACCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year ending</p>
<p>December 31, 1996 (in millions of crowns):</p>
<p>			     1995		  1995  </p>
<p> Net profit/loss     -99.964		23.541</p>
<p> Gross profit/loss  -122.751	     -14.965</p>
<p> Production	  1,534.000	   1,386.521</p>
<p> Total assets	2,819.607	   1,956.837</p>
<p> Basic capital     1,164.863	   1,164.863</p>
<p>Note: Results are calculated according the Czech accounting</p>
<p>standards. The company's full name is Prazske Pivovary a.s. It</p>
<p>is 55 percent owned by Britain's Bass plc .</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
